@startuml training_pipeline
skinparam backgroundColor #0C1022
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontColor #E8ECFF
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam roundcorner 20
skinparam ArrowColor #10C8C8
skinparam ArrowThickness 2
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #1E2747
  BorderColor #8B5CFF
  FontColor #FFFFFF
  ArrowColor #10C8C8
  StartColor #4A63FF
  EndColor #4A63FF
  BarColor #10C8C8
}
skinparam note { BackgroundColor #2A3358; BorderColor #8B5CFF; FontColor #E8ECFF }

title Signly Model Training Pipeline

start

:collect_imgs.py\nCapture webcam images per class\n(37 classes: A–Z, 0–9, space);

note right
  ~37 classes × N images each
  Stored in per-class subdirectories
end note

:create_dataset.py\nRun MediaPipe Hand Landmarker on each image\nExtract 42-feature landmark vector\n(21 × [x−minX, y−minY])\nSave labelled NumPy dataset (X, y);

:train_tflite_classifier.py\nLoad dataset, train/test split\nBuild Keras MLP:\n  Input(42) → Dense(ReLU) → Dense(ReLU) → Dense(37, softmax)\nTrain with Adam optimiser\nExport → asl_classifier.tflite via TFLiteConverter;

note right
  TFLiteConverter applies default
  float32 conversion (no quantisation
  loss at this stage)
end note

:test_tflite_parity.py\nRun both Keras model and TFLite interpreter\non held-out test-set feature vectors\nCompute label agreement rate;

if (Agreement ≥ 99% ?) then (yes)
  :prepare_mobile_assets.py\nCopy asl_classifier.tflite → Flutter assets/models/\nCopy labels.json → Flutter assets/models/\nCopy letter PNGs → assets/sign_language/letters/\nCopy word GIFs → assets/sign_language/gifs/;
  :Mobile app assets ready\nRun: flutter pub get && flutter run;
  stop
else (no)
  :Investigate TFLite conversion settings\n(try full_integer_quant or float16)\nRetrain or adjust model architecture;
  stop
endif
@enduml
